not r58 zirconia wideband / Rogowski / BAM; not r59 UV-DOAS SO2 / aluminum-oxide moisture / load-cell hopper. Plants not reused: Nettlewake, Frostlip, Oxbow, Fernwick, Mossfell, Kelpfen, Brackholt, Dewholt, Pebblewick, Hawkmere, Embercrag, Reedwhin, Wexmere, Glaurfen, Rushfen, Rimegait, Spelterfen, Kelpwharf, Yarrowfen, Sorrelwick, Tansyholt, Glimmerholt, Oreholt, Thornmere, Marlfell, Birchfen, plus the r13–r56 plant list carried in NOTES-r56.

This round introduces three unused industrial families (Stern-Volmer luminescence-quenching dissolved oxygen, catalytic-bead pellistor LEL, free-space FMCW tank-radar remaining level) on new invented plants. r13-holes cyclotron/alanine/ADCP and r56 densification leftovers (temperature-dependent IRIS c, slag-window pyrometer map, OIW quenching table) are not restaged.